<title>USA: Santa Clara, Calif., $175 mln notes won by BT.</title>
<headline>Santa Clara, Calif., $175 mln notes won by BT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said Tuesday it won $175 million Santa Clara, Calif., tax and revenue anticipation notes.</p>
<p>The firm won $75 million with a net interest cost of 3.996 percent, $50 million at 3.984 percent, and $50 million at 3.972 percent.</p>
<p>The notes carry a coupon of 4.75 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
